Cell["The spatial family: ArrayGraphics3D", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"e430c986-3e45-6845-ad2d-c78eadff478c"],

Cell["\<\
The same arrays, as cubes arranged in space. At order one a line of cubes, at \
order two a plane of them:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c3deb990-1c11-9d4c-8acb-0f021eeb68f1"],

