Cell["\<\
At order three, the full lattice. The entry at (i, j, k) sits at the point \
{i, j, k}, and a gnomon in the near corner says which way the three indices \
run:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"532289cd-4e35-5543-8470-658e2e68c5e9"],

