Cell["\<\
A partial identity is one where the indices at chosen positions agree, \
whatever the others do. Each of the three is a plane through the cube, and \
which plane it is depends on the pair:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2e0bfaca-098c-c348-867c-9a1d65f765c7"],

